Version: 2.0.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Jaime <info@inled.es>
Depends: x11-xserver-utils, driverman
Description: Welcome application for Pulsar OS.
 Shows a beautiful Apple-like hello animation and guides the user through
 screen resolution, bluetooth, software center, desktop effects, GPU drivers
 and feedback. Built with Tauri for native performance.
